<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>Neural Architecture: The point clouds of the environment are encoded and concatenated with the start and goal configuration. This vector is used as conditioning of the diffusion model, which generates a 16-step action sequence from a noise vector.</figcaption>
